// 1-1: every move. Blue comes back, then steps, double jump, spikes, thin floors, a chimney.
id l1-01
name 1-1 LAST MILE
tagline the internet is a series of tubes. you are not in a tube.
bg city
// RULES: what this room is about, how often each mechanic shows up, how hard each portion is (docs/level-design-rules.md)
main current plank
mechanics current:4 plank:5 colour:1
new current plank colour
portion 1 first jumps and the blue connector
portion 1 plank steps up
portion 1 short current patches, one jump each
hardness 1
map
