text IT'S DARK. YOU'RE HOLLOW.\nSOMETHING UP THERE IS STILL BLUE.\nTAP {jack} TO PLUG INTO IT.
text TOO TALL? JUMP, THEN JUMP AGAIN IN THE AIR.\nTHE SECOND ONE IS FREE.\nTHE FIRST ONE WAS ALSO FREE.
text CURRENT. A ZIGZAG OF LIVE VOLTAGE. DON'T TOUCH IT.\nSHORT PATCHES: ONE JUMP. LONG ONES: TWO.\nIT RUNS ALONG WALLS TOO. ONE TOUCH AND YOU'RE DEAD. THE ROOM RESETS.
text THIN FLOORS. JUMP UP THROUGH THEM.\nTO DROP DOWN: HOLD {down}, TAP {jump}.\nUP THE STACK, THEN DOWN THE OTHER SIDE.
text CHIMNEY. WALLS ARE STICKY.\nJUMP INTO A WALL, JUMP OFF IT TO THE OTHER ONE.\nBOUNCE YOUR WAY UP. THE EXIT IS AT THE TOP.
entity {"type": "connector", "x": 10, "y": 17, "color": "blue"}
